  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Career options in commerce without maths are wider than most families think, because only a short list of degrees and exams checks for a maths subject on your marksheet.</strong>
    CA, most BBA programmes, bank PO, law, marketing, HR and accounting practice stay open. What closes is narrow and specific, and the list is short enough to check yourself, so you can build a high-income skill portfolio without guessing.
  </p>

  <figure class="article-visual article-cover-visual">
