      <ul>
        <li>Your marks or confidence in maths are already under strain and you have solid alternatives.</li>
        <li>You are targeting CA, law, marketing, HR or accounting practice, where it is not a gate.</li>
        <li>You would rather use the time to build a skill.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
